@startuml
title PSO Training Sequence

actor User
participant "PSOTrainer" as T
participant "PSO Integration\n(pso_integration)" as I
participant "Evaluator\n(SingleEpisode)" as E
participant "PettingZooWrapper" as W
database "Registry" as R

== Setup ==
User -> T: train(config)
T -> T: _translate_budget(config)
T -> W: reset(seed=0)
W --> T: observations
T -> T: derive input/output sizes
T -> I: setup_pso_swarm(genome_config, pop_size, phi1, phi2, weight)
I -> I: probe genome → dimension N
I --> T: (pso_state, dimension)
T -> I: make_pso_ind_init(genome_config, pso_state)
I --> T: ind_init closure
T -> E: SingleEpisodeEvaluator(env_wrapper, max_steps)
T -> I: register_pso_toolbox(pso_state, ind_init, evaluator)
I -> I: register toolbox.generate / update / evaluate
I --> T: toolbox

== Training loop (per generation) ==
T -> T: toolbox.generate()
T --> T: population (N particles)
loop for each particle
  T -> E: evaluate(particle, seed)
  E -> W: reset(seed)
  E -> E: run episode
  E --> T: (fitness,)
end
T -> T: toolbox.update(population)
note right: velocity/position update\npersonal+global best tracking

T -> T: HallOfFame.update(population)
T -> T: stats.compile(population)
T -> T: aggregate real env steps\n(evaluator.env_steps_consumed + step_sink)
note right: budget_on_consumed=True (opt-in):\nloop until consumed >= ENV_STEPS budget\ninstead of a fixed num_generations

== Result ==
T -> T: champion = hof[0].genome
T -> T: GenomePolicyWrapper(champion) → PolicyProtocol
T --> User: TrainingResult(policy, metrics)\nmetrics include env_steps_nominal\n+ env_steps_consumed (real ticks)
@enduml
